        "visual_fallback": "glowing hot lava"
      },
      {
        "narration": "How did prehistoric tribes generate industrial infernos on freezing, wind-swept hilltops?",
        "visual_query": "ancient celtic hill fort scotland",
        "visual_fallback": "wind swept grassy hills"
      },
      {
        "narration": "While early antiquarians imagined ancient superweapons, archaeologists found these fort ramparts were built with dense internal timber frameworks.",
        "visual_query": "archaeological excavation stone wall",
        "visual_fallback": "stone wall excavation"
